    "title": "Who does Iowa basketball play next in Elite Eight bracket?",
    "text": "IOWA MEN'S BASKETBALLWho does Iowa basketball play next in NCAA Tournament bracket?HawkCentral staff reportDes Moines RegisterUpdated March 26, 2026, 11:18 p.m. CTKeep WatchingIowa men's basketball now knows its Elite Eight opponent for March Madness.After taking down Nebraska on Thursday, the 9-seed Hawkeyes (25-12) are set to play No. 3-seed Illinois (27-8) in the Elite Eight of the NCAA Tournament on Saturday, March 28, at Toyota Center in Houston, Texas. Tip-off for the Elite Eight game is slated for 5:09 p.m. CT and will be broadcast on TBS and truTV.Tickets for Iowa vs Illinois in NCAA Tournament Elite EightThe Illini took down 2-seed Houston on Thursday night. In Iowa's lone meeting with Illinois this season, it lost, 75-69, in Iowa City.4 men on the floor, 4 thoughts from Iowa's Sweet 16 win | Leistikow No, this isn't a dream. Iowa basketball is in the Elite Eight. Another stunner for the Iowa men, who rally to Elite Eight | Leistikow Likes, dislikes from Iowa basketball's Sweet 16 victory over Nebraska Chad Leistikow reacts as Iowa basketball topples Nebraska to advance to Elite Eight See our 10 best photos from Iowa basketball vs Nebraska Sweet 16 When was the last time Iowa basketball played in the Elite Eight? Social media reacts to Iowa basketball's Sweet 16 upset win vs Nebraska Nebraska makes major crunchtime mistake in Sweet 16 vs Iowa basketballOur team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.Memory Loss Begins When You Can't Say This WordHealthFrontLine | AdAdLearn MoreUndoSide Sleepers Get Achy Shoulders, Few Know This \"Side Sleeper\" TrickSleep Digest Publication | AdAdUndo$25 Patch Is Going Viral After Shocking Weight Loss PhotosBetterLiving | AdAdUndoWhy Your Rotator Cuff Isn't Healing (It’s Not Just Age)Shoulder Relief News | AdAdUndoDoctors Question Popular Drink Lin